    },
    {
      "displayText": "这只野生的火狐狸\n好像没什么活力……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD953EA91CE751F7684706B72D072F8000A597D50CF6CA14EC04E486D3B529B2026202600100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547C202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "给它食物也不吃，\n带去宝可梦中心也搞不清原因……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED95B8398DF72694E5F4E0D5403FF0C000A5E2653BB5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC34E5F641E4E0D6E05539F56E02026202600100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中药局！如果是曾经开在\n密阿雷的那家中药局的老店长，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n或许会知道什么药对火狐狸有效。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D836F5C40FF015982679C662F66FE7ECF5F005728000A5BC6963F96F7768490A35BB64E2D836F5C40768480015E97957FFF0C00100001BE00000A62168BB84F1A77E590534EC04E48836F5BF9706B72D072F867096548300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会看着火狐狸的，\n你去问问老店长吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A770B7740706B72D072F87684FF0C000A4F6053BB95EE95EE80015E97957F5427300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中药局的老店长呀，\n是时髦咖啡馆的常客哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D836F5C40768480015E97957F5440FF0C000A662F65F69AE654965561998676845E385BA254E6300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中药局的老店长呀，\n是时髦咖啡馆的常客哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D836F5C40768480015E97957F5440FF0C000A662F65F69AE654965561998676845E385BA254E6300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你找我有什么事？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60627E621167094EC04E484E8BFF1F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是中药局的人吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F4E2D836F5C4076844EBA5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有宝可梦不舒服",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67095B9D53EF68A64E0D8212670D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来如此……\n是火狐狸身体不适啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F676559826B6420262026000A662F706B72D072F88EAB4F534E0D9002554A3002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火狐狸这种宝可梦啊，\n会通过进食小树枝变得充满活力，静心凝神。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B72D072F88FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6554AFF0C000A4F1A901A8FC78FDB98DF5C0F6811679D53D85F9751456EE16D3B529BFF0C97595FC351DD795E3002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "特别是吃下活力小树枝的话，\n一眨眼就能恢复活力了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7279522B662F54034E0B6D3B529B5C0F6811679D76848BDDFF0C000A4E007728773C5C3180FD6062590D6D3B529B4E863002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可是能采到活力小树枝的地方\n现在变成了5号野生特区……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF662F80FD91C752306D3B529B5C0F6811679D7684573065B9000A73B0572853D862104E86003553F791CE751F7279533A20262026001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要在遭受宝可梦攻击的情况下\n寻找活力小树枝一定很辛苦……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但去找散发着甜甜的香气的小树枝准没错。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815728906D53D75B9D53EF68A6653B51FB768460C551B54E0B000A5BFB627E6D3B529B5C0F6811679D4E005B9A5F888F9B82E62026202600100001BE00000A4F4653BB627E656353D17740751C751C768499996C1476845C0F6811679D51C66CA195193002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "活力小树枝在浦蓝区\n5号野生特区或许能采到。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那是散发着甜甜的香气的小树枝哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D3B529B5C0F6811679D57286D6684DD533A000A003553F791CE751F7279533A62168BB880FD91C75230300200100001BE00000A90A3662F656353D17740751C751C768499996C1476845C0F6811679D54E63002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有点干干的……\n这似乎不是活力小树枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670970B95E725E72768420262026000A8FD94F3C4E4E4E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6811679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有被啃过的痕迹……\n这似乎不是活力小树枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670988AB55438FC7768475D58FF920262026000A8FD94F3C4E4E4E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6811679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些弯折了……\n这似乎不是活力小树枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B5F2F62984E8620262026000A8FD94F3C4E4E4E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6811679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "失去柔韧性了……\n这似乎不是活力小树枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "593153BB67D497E760274E8620262026000A8FD94F3C4E4E4E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6811679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有甜甜的香气……\n找到活力小树枝了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6709751C751C768499996C1420262026000A627E52306D3B529B5C0F6811679D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回到没有活力的\n火狐狸身边吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE52306CA167096D3B529B7684000A706B72D072F88EAB8FB95427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "活力小树枝……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n中药局的老店长确实高明，\n你能把它采回来也很厉害！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D3B529B5C0F6811679D2026202600100001BE01000A4E2D836F5C40768480015E97957F786E5B9E9AD8660EFF0C000A4F6080FD628A5B8391C756DE67654E5F5F8853895BB3FF0100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "赶快喂给火狐狸吃吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D765FEB55827ED9706B72D072F854035427300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n给火狐狸喂了活力小树枝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000000A7ED9706B72D072F855824E866D3B529B5C0F6811679DFF0100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太好了～\n火狐狸恢复活力了……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A597D4E86FF5E000A706B72D072F86062590D6D3B529B4E8620262026FF0100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547CFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀哎呀，这只火狐狸\n好像喜欢上你啦～<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要不就让它成为你的伙伴吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE544054CE5440FF0C8FD953EA706B72D072F8000A597D50CF559C6B224E0A4F605566FF5E00100001BE00000A89814E0D5C318BA95B8362104E3A4F6076844F194F345427FF1F00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547CFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捉到火狐狸了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63495230706B72D072F84E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要好好珍惜火狐狸哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981597D597D73CD60DC706B72D072F854E6300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想让火狐狸成为伙伴，\n就请整理一下盒子吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F38BA9706B72D072F862104E3A4F194F34FF0C000A5C318BF7657474064E004E0B76D25B50542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
